msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: EduKenya\n"
"Language: sw\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);\n"

# settings.LANGUAGES
msgid "English"
msgstr "Kiingereza"

msgid "Kiswahili"
msgstr "Kiswahili"

# Header
msgid "Skip to main content"
msgstr "Ruka hadi maudhui makuu"

msgid "EduKenya home"
msgstr "Ukurasa mkuu wa EduKenya"

msgid "Main"
msgstr "Kuu"

msgid "How it works"
msgstr "Jinsi inavyofanya kazi"

msgid "Features"
msgstr "Vipengele"

msgid "For schools"
msgstr "Kwa shule"

msgid "Choose language"
msgstr "Chagua lugha"

msgid "Register your school"
msgstr "Sajili shule yako"

# Hero
msgid "Made for CBC Grades 7 and 8"
msgstr "Imeundwa kwa Gredi 7 na 8 za CBC"

msgid "Learning that fits you."
msgstr "Masomo yanayokufaa wewe."

msgid ""
"EduKenya is a smart learning buddy that explains every CBC topic in a way "
"that makes sense to you, and checks you really get it before you move on."
msgstr ""
"EduKenya ni rafiki mwerevu wa kujifunza anayeeleza kila mada ya CBC kwa "
"njia unayoielewa, na kuhakikisha umeelewa kweli kabla ya kuendelea."

msgid "See how it works"
msgstr "Tazama jinsi inavyofanya kazi"

msgid "Follows the CBC curriculum"
msgstr "Inafuata mtaala wa CBC"

msgid "English and Kiswahili"
msgstr "Kiingereza na Kiswahili"

msgid "Students, teachers and parents"
msgstr "Wanafunzi, walimu na wazazi"

msgid "A learning map showing topics linked from Grade 6 to Grade 8"
msgstr "Ramani ya kujifunza inayoonyesha mada zilizounganishwa kutoka Gredi 6 hadi Gredi 8"

msgid "Grade 6"
msgstr "Gredi 6"

msgid "Grade 7"
msgstr "Gredi 7"

msgid "Grade 8"
msgstr "Gredi 8"

msgid "Fractions"
msgstr "Sehemu"

msgid "Ratios"
msgstr "Uwiano"

msgid "Percentages"
msgstr "Asilimia"

msgid "Proportion"
msgstr "Sawia"

msgid "You are here"
msgstr "Uko hapa"

# How we are different
msgid "Not your usual e-learning"
msgstr "Si masomo ya mtandaoni ya kawaida"

msgid ""
"Most e-learning sites give everyone the same notes and one quiz. EduKenya "
"works differently."
msgstr ""
"Tovuti nyingi za masomo huwapa wote maelezo yale yale na jaribio moja. "
"EduKenya ni tofauti."

msgid "Usual e-learning"
msgstr "Masomo ya kawaida ya mtandaoni"

msgid "With EduKenya"
msgstr "Ukiwa na EduKenya"

msgid "Same notes for every learner"
msgstr "Maelezo yale yale kwa kila mwanafunzi"

msgid "One quiz, then move on"
msgstr "Jaribio moja, kisha unaendelea"

msgid "Topics feel disconnected"
msgstr "Mada hazihusiani"

msgid "Answers from anywhere online"
msgstr "Majibu kutoka popote mtandaoni"

msgid "Lessons rewritten to suit how you learn"
msgstr "Masomo huandikwa upya kulingana na jinsi unavyojifunza"

msgid "Practise until you truly get it"
msgstr "Fanya mazoezi hadi uelewe kweli"

msgid "Every topic links to what comes next"
msgstr "Kila mada inaunganishwa na inayofuata"

msgid "Answers only from CBC materials"
msgstr "Majibu kutoka kwa nyenzo za CBC pekee"

# Features
msgid "What makes EduKenya special"
msgstr "Kinachoifanya EduKenya kuwa ya kipekee"

msgid "Built on CBC"
msgstr "Imejengwa juu ya CBC"

msgid ""
"Our AI reads only from approved CBC materials, so every answer matches what "
"you learn in class."
msgstr ""
"Akili bandia yetu husoma nyenzo za CBC zilizoidhinishwa pekee, hivyo kila "
"jibu linalingana na unachojifunza darasani."

msgid "Explained your way"
msgstr "Imeelezwa kwa njia yako"

msgid ""
"Stuck? Ask for a new explanation. EduKenya rewrites the lesson with simpler "
"words, examples or pictures."
msgstr ""
"Umekwama? Omba maelezo mapya. EduKenya huandika somo upya kwa maneno rahisi, "
"mifano au picha."

msgid "Master it, then move on"
msgstr "Elewa kwanza, kisha endelea"

msgid ""
"Each topic has a few short tests. Get them right and the next topic unlocks."
msgstr ""
"Kila mada ina majaribio mafupi machache. Ukiyapita, mada inayofuata "
"inafunguka."

msgid "Everything connects"
msgstr "Kila kitu kinaungana"

msgid ""
"Topics are linked like a map, so what you learn in Grade 7 leads smoothly "
"into Grade 8."
msgstr ""
"Mada zimeunganishwa kama ramani, hivyo unachojifunza Gredi 7 kinakuongoza "
"vizuri hadi Gredi 8."

# How it works
msgid "How learning works"
msgstr "Jinsi kujifunza kunavyofanya kazi"

msgid "Learn"
msgstr "Jifunze"

msgid "Read a short lesson made for you."
msgstr "Soma somo fupi lililoandaliwa kwa ajili yako."

msgid "Practise"
msgstr "Fanya mazoezi"

msgid "Try a few quick questions."
msgstr "Jaribu maswali machache ya haraka."

msgid "Get help"
msgstr "Pata msaada"

msgid "Not quite? Get a fresh explanation and try again."
msgstr "Bado hujaelewa? Pata maelezo mapya na ujaribu tena."

msgid "Level up"
msgstr "Panda ngazi"

msgid "Pass and unlock the next topic."
msgstr "Pita na ufungue mada inayofuata."

# For schools
msgid "One place for the whole school"
msgstr "Mahali pamoja kwa shule nzima"

msgid ""
"EduKenya also does the everyday school jobs, so you do not need another "
"system."
msgstr ""
"EduKenya pia hushughulikia kazi za kila siku za shule, hivyo huhitaji mfumo "
"mwingine."

msgid "Students"
msgstr "Wanafunzi"

msgid "Lessons and tests"
msgstr "Masomo na majaribio"

msgid "Assignments"
msgstr "Kazi za ziada"

msgid "My grades"
msgstr "Alama zangu"

msgid "Teachers"
msgstr "Walimu"

msgid "Track each learner's progress"
msgstr "Fuatilia maendeleo ya kila mwanafunzi"

msgid "Set and mark assignments"
msgstr "Toa na usahihishe kazi"

msgid "Spot who needs help early"
msgstr "Tambua mapema anayehitaji msaada"

msgid "Parents"
msgstr "Wazazi"

msgid "View grades and reports"
msgstr "Tazama alama na ripoti"

msgid "Check fee balances"
msgstr "Angalia salio la karo"

msgid "See what your child is learning"
msgstr "Ona mtoto wako anachojifunza"

msgid "School admins"
msgstr "Wasimamizi wa shule"

msgid "Manage student records"
msgstr "Simamia rekodi za wanafunzi"

msgid "Manage fees"
msgstr "Simamia karo"

msgid "Add teachers and classes"
msgstr "Ongeza walimu na madarasa"

# Call to action / footer
msgid "Bring EduKenya to your school"
msgstr "Leta EduKenya shuleni kwako"

msgid ""
"Set up your school in a few minutes. Every school gets its own private space."
msgstr ""
"Sajili shule yako kwa dakika chache. Kila shule inapata nafasi yake ya "
"faragha."

msgid "All rights reserved."
msgstr "Haki zote zimehifadhiwa."
